169
00:14:44,385 --> 00:14:45,899
Speaker 0: You're just an empty vessel.

170
00:14:46,422 --> 00:14:54,317
Speaker 0: And into that vessel goes not only the different narrative voices, but also you as the player.

171
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:57,480
Speaker 0: You have all the memories of playing this game.

172
00:14:57,660 --> 00:14:58,999
Speaker 0: You know what's going to happen.

173
00:14:59,180 --> 00:15:00,260
Speaker 0: You have all these.

174
00:15:00,400 --> 00:15:04,198
Speaker 1: And that's sort of the fun trick of the game, because you remember as a player.

175
00:15:05,503 --> 00:15:09,239
